.TH "pango-view" "1" "" "Pango" "Pango commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pango-view \- Pango text viewer
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
\fBpango\-view\fP [OPTIONS...] FILE
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBpango\-view\fP formats a text using Pango, with options to exercise
most of Pango\(aqs layout features.
.SH HELP OPTIONS
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show help options.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-help\-all\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show all help options.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-help\-cairo\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show help for options understood by the cairo backend.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-version\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Print the command\(aqs version and exit.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH CAIRO BACKEND OPTIONS
.sp
\fB\-\-annotate=FLAGS\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Annotate the output. Comma\-separated list of gravity, progression, baselines,
layout, line, run, cluster, char, glyph, caret, slope
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH APPLICATION OPTIONS
.sp
\fB\-\-no\-auto\-dir\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
No layout direction according to contents.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-backend=cairo/xft/ft2\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Pango backend to use for rendering (default: cairo).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-background=red/#rrggbb/#rrggbbaa/transparent\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set the background color.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-q, \-\-no\-display\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Do not display (just write to file or whatever).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-dpi=number\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set the resolution.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-align=left/center/right\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set text alignment.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-ellipsize=start/middle/end\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set ellipsization mode.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-font=description\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set the font description.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-foreground=red/#rrggbb/#rrggbbaa\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set the text color.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-gravity=south/east/north/west/auto\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set base gravity: glyph rotation.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-gravity\-hint=natural/strong/line\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set gravity hint.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-header\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Display the options in the output.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-height=+points/\-numlines\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set height in points (positive) or number of lines (negative) for ellipsizing.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-hinting=none/auto/slight/medium/full\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set hinting style.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-antialias=none/gray/subpixel\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set antialiasing.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-hint\-metrics=on/off\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set hint metrics.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-subpixel\-positions\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set subpixel positioning.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-subpixel\-order=rgb/bgr/vrgb/vbgr\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set subpixel order.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-indent=points\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set paragraph indentation (in points).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-spacing=points\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set line spacing (in points).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-line\-spacing=factor\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set spread factor for line height.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-justify\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Stretch paragraph lines to be justified.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-justify\-last\-line\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Justify the last line of the paragraph.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-language=en_US/etc\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set language to use for font selection.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-margin=CSS\-style numbers in pixels\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set the margin on the output in pixels.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-markup\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Interpret text as Pango markup.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-o, \-\-output=file\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Save rendered image to output file.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-pixels\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Use pixel units instead of points (sets dpi to 72).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-pango\-units\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Use Pango units instead of points.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-rtl\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set base direction to right\-to\-left.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-rotate=degrees\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Set angle at which to rotate results,
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-n, \-\-runs=integer\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Run Pango layout engine this many times.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-single\-par\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Enable single\-paragraph mode.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-t, \-\-text=string\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Text to display (instead of a file).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-waterfall\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Create a waterfall display.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-w, \-\-width=points\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Width in points to which to wrap lines or ellipsize.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-wrap=word/char/word\-char\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Text wrapping mode (needs a width to be set).
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-serialized=FILE\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Create layout from a serialized file,
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-serialize\-to=FILE\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
